From: Lynx Launcher maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] Reduce the Linux launcher SDK size

Restore hidden-by-default symbol visibility for the Linux SDK. Public Lynx
CAPI, value API, and weak N-API entry points carry explicit default visibility,
while internal Lynx, Clay, Skia, and C++ runtime symbols do not need to remain
in the dynamic symbol table used by the launcher.

Keep the statically linked LLVM unwinder local to liblynx. Exporting only the
unwinder while hiding its matching libc++ ABI runtime lets it interpose on the
launcher's system libstdc++ exception path and produces recursive termination.

Exclude development and runtime compilation features that the launcher does
not use: Inspector/LogBox services, the Lepus source compiler, Skottie, and the
Wuffs GIF decoder. Keep QuickJS, N-API, SVG, text shaping, ICU, and fontconfig
fallback enabled for the shipped UI and desktop icon formats.

This is a narrow integration patch for the pinned Linux windowless SDK.

diff --git a/platform/linux/BUILD.gn b/platform/linux/BUILD.gn
--- a/platform/linux/BUILD.gn
+++ b/platform/linux/BUILD.gn
@@ -12,3 +12,6 @@ shared_library("linux") {
   deps = [ ":lynx_linux_group" ]
-
+
+  # Keep the bundled LLVM unwinder paired with Lynx's private C++ runtime.
+  ldflags = [ "-Wl,--exclude-libs=libunwind.a" ]
+
   libs = [
diff --git a/platform/linux/build_release.py b/platform/linux/build_release.py
--- a/platform/linux/build_release.py
+++ b/platform/linux/build_release.py
@@ -12,6 +12,6 @@ from pathlib import Path
 COMMON_GN_ARGS = [
     'enable_clay_standalone = true',
-    'disable_visibility_hidden = true',
+    'disable_visibility_hidden = false',
     'use_ndk_static_cxx = false',
     'enable_linker_map = false',
     'enable_clay = true',
@@ -22,7 +22,7 @@ COMMON_GN_ARGS = [
     'skia_enable_pdf = false',
     'skia_enable_svg = true',
     'enable_svg = true',
-    'skia_enable_skottie = true',
+    'skia_enable_skottie = false',
     'skia_use_x11 = false',
-    'skia_use_wuffs = true',
+    'skia_use_wuffs = false',
     'skia_use_expat = true',
@@ -34,10 +34,11 @@ COMMON_GN_ARGS = [
     'stripped_symbols = true',
     'is_official_build = true',
     'use_clang_static_analyzer = false',
     'enable_lto = false',
+    'build_lepus_compile = false',
     'enable_lepusng_worklet = true',
     'enable_napi_binding = true',
-    'enable_inspector = true',
+    'enable_inspector = false',
     'jsengine_type = "quickjs"',
     'use_flutter_cxx = true',
     'is_debug = false',
